# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Evergreen Lawn Care — NEVER publish these to GitHub Pages / the live site
# (active .gitignore — operationalizes gitignore-for-new-clone.txt)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Google Apps Script source — contains the live Stripe sk_live_ key.
# This is PASTE-ONLY into the Apps Script editor; it must never be served.
apps-script.txt
apps-script*.txt
# 2026-09-10: the rules above only match the HYPHENATED name. "appscript backup.txt"
# (no hyphen, a space) slipped past every one of them and sat untracked in the repo
# holding a live key — one `git add -A` from being published. Match the unhyphenated
# spellings and any "backup" variant too. Never narrow these.
appscript*.txt
*apps*script*backup*.txt
*appscript*.txt

# EVERY Apps Script file. This repo is PUBLIC and serves GitHub Pages, and these
# carry shared secrets, sheet IDs, and API keys in plain text. RETELL-BRIDGE.gs
# alone holds the only auth on the phone-agent web app. Paste-only, never commit.
*.gs
Broccoli-Setup/

# Loose backend notes that quote URLs, secrets, or tokens.
EMAIL-FIX-gmail-api.txt
calendar-emoji-tagger.txt

# Stripe secrets / backup codes
stripe*.txt

# Local databases (not part of the website)
*.db

# Internal multi-agent "operating system" scaffold + all backups (key-bearing)
_Evergreen-OS/

# Editor / manual backups (these embed old copies of the key + SCRIPT_URL)
*.bak
*.bak-*
*.bak.*
*.bak-*.html
index.html.bak*

# Working notes / internal docs — not for the live site
CHAT_CONTEXT.md
*.md
*.docx
site-audit-report.html

# Raw data export (review before serving)
data.json

# Unused photo staging
Photos/Unused/

# OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
